    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW28UshuPex7Q74iy2gXh676H)_\n\n## What\n- New `:collection` column for query tables: the title (`#+title:`) of the note that the `bib-parent` link points at, linked to it. Empty without a parent.\n- The default Works and Edited works specs get the column after `:title`. `incollection` notes stay independent rows (not folded); `booksection` still folds into its book.\n- `:fold-tag` also accepts a list of tags (small generalisation, tested).\n- Docs and tests updated.\n\n## Notes\n- Existing blocks are not rewritten: add `:collection` to their `:columns` by hand.\n- Not yet explained: why `incollection` notes did not show up in the table at all. The query matches on `pub-author`, so I need a sample note from the vault to confirm.\n- No CHANGELOG edit (nightly tidy owns it). Tested in Emacs 29.3 with stubs, not on the real vault.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiD49hEeJCwd214jHzL",
